        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88SRH, 88 Series Wall Mounted Towel or Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, it's a beautiful, modern way to keep things off the floor in any room. This bathroom towel hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The 88 Series Robe Hook a sleek contemporary look that will look good in even the most fashionable homes. It is available in either satin nickel or polished chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88SRH-specifications.gif?v=1704354567\" width=\"553\" height=\"299\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88SRH 88 Series Single Robe Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Series Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Tip Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88SRH.pdf?v=1691095355\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88SRH 88 Series Single Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
